 "slabs": {
  "source_status": "current standard (Oregon Standard Drawings 2024, eff. 2026-06-01)",
  "geometry_notes": [
   "48 in wide; keyway read from each END VIEW: top 3 in band inset 3/8 in, 4 in key band with 3/8 in upper and 3/4 in lower transitions to a 3/4 in key recess, full width below. Square corners (only an optional 1 in max chamfer at skewed slab ENDS in plan).",
   "Circular voids from each MIDSPAN VIEW, centred at mid-depth: 15 in: 3 x 8 in at 1'-3\" centres; 18 in: 3 x 10 in at 1'-2 1/2\"; 21 in: 10 in centre void + 2 x 12 in outer voids at 1'-2\"; 26 in: 2 x 15 3/4 in (16 in acceptable) at 1'-10\"; 30 in: 2 x 17 3/4 in (18 in acceptable) at 1'-10\". The 15 3/4 and 17 3/4 in diameters are used. Voids polygonised with 96 segments.",
   "Printed section properties reproduced within 0.5 in2 area, 0.01 in c.g. and 0.02% I."
  ],
