 "i_girders": {
  "source_status": "current standard (Oregon Standard Drawings 2024, eff. 2026-06-01; sheets dated 20-APR-2018)",
  "geometry_notes": [
   "MIDSPAN SECTION of each sheet. ODOT-specific sheets; dimensions happen to coincide with the classic AASHTO Types II-IV but are transcribed from the ODOT drawings, not transferred. ODOT 'Type V' is a 63 in I-girder (Type IV flanges, 2'-8\" web), not the AASHTO Type V bulb.",
   "Soffit corners: 'Chamfer soffit corners 1\" max. (typ)'. CONVENTION: modelled at the stated 1 in maximum.",
   "No section properties are printed on the ODOT sheets; tests check analytic consistency only."
